schema: "0.4"
id: npl-aurora-06-organization-picker
type: image
quality: high

# NoizuPromptLingo (NPL) — a workspace for teams who build, run, and supervise AI agents — Organization Picker screen.
# Theme's reference screen (treatise §5): one focused choice per viewport, airy, never a dense grid.
# Theme tenets: warm cream canvas, single grape-violet accent, 14px radius + pill buttons, resting soft shadows.
# Palette: cream #fff9f4, warm plum-ink #37303a, grape violet #6b4de6, soft coral #f4776b, warm gold #f2b054.

prompt:
  system: |
    You are a senior product designer rendering a high-fidelity UI mockup of a
    WARM, WELCOMING "choose your organization" landing screen — the first thing a
    user sees after signing in. Calm and airy, a few generous choices rather than a
    dense grid. Rounded humanist sans-serif (NO serif). Gentle depth from soft
    resting shadows, no hard borders.
  text: |
    A 16:9 high-fidelity UI mockup of the Organization Picker screen of
    NoizuPromptLingo (NPL), a workspace where teams build, run, and supervise AI
    agents. The signed-in user picks which organization to enter — a warm, low-
    pressure choice with plenty of room to breathe.

    OVERALL LAYOUT (a centered, airy column — deliberately NOT a dense grid):
    - A slim floating TOP BAR on a soft shadow: rounded "NPL" wordmark at left, a
      small round user-avatar and a quiet menu at right.
    - A centered WELCOME HEADER band: heading "Choose an organization" in a heavier
      rounded weight, muted subhead "Pick up where your team left off."
    - A slim rounded ORG SEARCH / FILTER BAR (pill-shaped input, soft inner
      shadow, magnifier glyph, placeholder "Search organizations").
    - An ORGANIZATION CARD SET of just 3–4 generous rounded cards in a roomy row or
      soft two-up layout (never a tight many-column grid), each resting on its own
      soft warm drop-shadow.

    EACH ORG CARD (generously rounded, floating on soft shadow, 20–24px padding):
    - A soft rounded monogram/avatar tile in a warm tint, the organization name in
      a 600 weight (e.g. "Northwind Labs", "Aurora Studio", "Kettle & Co"), and a
      muted role line ("Owner" / "Member").
    - A RECENT ACTIVITY SNIPPET: two muted lines like "3 sessions this week ·
      2 open tickets" with a tiny warm activity sparkline or dots.
    - On one card, a soft hover-lift state (raised one shadow step, faintly warmed).
    - A final CREATE-ORGANIZATION CARD rendered as a soft dashed-tint tile with a
      pill "+ Create organization" button in grape-violet.

    PALETTE & TYPE: warm cream canvas (a soft aurora wash only faintly in the
    header backdrop, never behind card text), deep warm plum-ink text, one
    grape-violet accent on the create pill and active states, warm-tinted neutral
    card fills. Rounded humanist sans-serif everywhere (high x-height, soft
    terminals) — no serif; monospace only if a tiny org-key chip appears.

    SHAPE & SURFACE: soft and floating. 14px+ rounded cards, pill button and pill
    search field, no hard borders — every separation is a warm resting drop-shadow
    plus a gentle cream-to-warmer-cream tonal step. This screen is the clearest
    showcase of the theme's signature resting elevation.

    MOOD: welcoming, calm, unhurried — "take your time, you belong here." Airy,
    warm, adult; premium soft-light product, never a dense dashboard or terminal.
  negative: "watermark, signature, lorem ipsum placeholder text, low-fidelity wireframe, monitor/device photograph framing, blurry, distorted UI, hard black borders, sharp square corners, dark terminal theme, dense many-column grid"

output:
  formats:
    - format: png
  dimensions:
    width: 1920
    height: 1080
    aspect_ratio: "16:9"

eval:
  pass_threshold: 0.72
  criteria:
    relevance: {weight: 3, description: "Matches Organization Picker: a search/filter bar, 3-4 generous org cards each with name/role and a recent-activity snippet, and a create-organization affordance"}
    theme_fidelity: {weight: 3, description: "Warm cream canvas, grape-violet pill accent, generously rounded floating cards on resting soft shadows, airy (not a dense grid), rounded humanist sans"}
    composition: {weight: 2, description: "Calm airy hierarchy, a few generous choices, whitespace as a feature, plausible real product"}
    technical: {weight: 2, description: "Sharp, correct 16:9 aspect, no artifacts"}
  reject_if:
    - "lorem ipsum or placeholder text visible"
    - "watermark or signature visible"
    - "wireframe-level fidelity instead of high-fidelity mockup"
    - "hard-edged or dark-terminal aesthetic instead of warm soft onboarding"
    - "dense many-column grid instead of a few generous cards"

tags: [npl-aurora, NoizuPromptLingo, screen-mockup]
